WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:10.770
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:04.850
Huh?

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:05.950
Seriously?

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:08.790
And you <i>still</i> want to become a pâtissière?

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.490
I've been trying my hardest, you know!

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:15.820
Caramel, are you sleeping? Wake up!

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:17.880
Caramel! Wake up!

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:25.090
Oh... good morning.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:28.830
It's not "good morning"! It's already evening!

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:32.330
Where am I?

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:39.890
In the classroom! Since Kashino and the others are going to make cheesecake in the next lesson, we're discussing it right now!

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:42.920
I see...

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:45.630
Snap out of it and get serious!

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:47.930
I'm sorry.

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:52.250
She looks really sleepy.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:55.000
Lately, she's been working hard late at night.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.030
Have you finished the report for the Kingdom of Sweets yet?

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:01.460
About that... I still haven't finished it.

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:04.460
Eh!? You still haven't handed it in?

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:06.590
The deadline is the day after tomorrow, isn't it?

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:11.380
I can't think of anything good right now to write... has everyone else already finished it?

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:14.470
Obviously! I handed mine in last week!

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:16.890
I sent mine three days ago.

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:19.960
I finished it a month ago.

00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:23.270
Still, Caramel really is trying her best.

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:25.890
It'll be fine. I'm sure you'll make a splendid report.

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:28.360
Yes! I'll do my best.

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:30.720
Naïve! You're too naïve!

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.000
The ingredients are cream cheese and sour cream...

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:38.240
Hey, both ingredients are made with cream, so what's the difference?

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:41.070
A-MA-NO!!!

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:41.740
Eh? What?

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:43.910
You don't even know the differences between the ingredients!?

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:49.020
And you still want to make a cheesecake and aim to be a pâtissière!? That sounds like a total joke!

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:50.680
B-But...

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:53.840
Now, now. There's still some time before the next self-study session,

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:57.760
so how about going out tomorrow to check out the place where the ingredients are made?

00:01:57.980 --> 00:01:59.950
The place where the ingredients are made?

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:03.680
A picture is worth a thousand words.
Everyone, let's go to the farm.

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:06.020
Farm!!

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.780
OP sequence

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:15.060
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:15.060
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:20.450
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:20.450
I'll give you happiness, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:25.920
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, hapinesu made go!

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:25.920
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, Happiness made go!

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:31.100
chansu no tobira aketa toki kara kibun joujou ↑ ↑

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:31.100
Since I opened the door of chance, my mood lifted.

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:35.070
youkoso suiitsu no oukoku he

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:35.070
Welcome to the Kingdom of Sweets.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:35.980
Bon appétit!

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:43.350
hajimehane, hetappi demo megezu ni hibishoujin<i>!</i>

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:43.350
Though I was terrible at the beginning, I was diligent everyday<i>!</i>

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.040
「makeruna<i>! atashi」</i>

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.040
「I won't lose<i>!</i> I said to myself」

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:47.000
Courage!

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:53.780
My dream migakeba hikaru takaramono

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:53.780
My dream when polished is a shining treasure.

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:56.550
fairy chikara kashite<i>!</i>

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:56.550
Fairy, lend me your strength<i>!</i>

