00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:05.080
The history of cheesecake.

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:11.950
The cheesecake is a pastry said to have a history dating back to Ancient Greek times.

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:17.290
However, the cheesecakes of that era seem to be a little different from the present ones.

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:23.840
Its emergence is in Poland, called the "Land of Fields". The cheesecake was born during the Middle ages.

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:26.880
There are three main types of cheesecake.

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:30.240
First is baked cheesecake.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:34.650
It's made by gently coating cream, sugar, and egg yolk on top of the slightly yet richly flavoured surface,

00:23:34.650 --> 00:23:38.140
and then putting it into the oven for it to bake.

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:41.690
Next is soufflé cheesecake.

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:47.260
Made by mixing eggs and cheese well, and then baking it, resulting in a soft and fluffy cake.

00:23:47.900 --> 00:23:50.320
The last one is a layer cheesecake.

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:55.900
Without reducing heat, combine the cream cheese with fresh cream, cool it and have it harden before eating.

00:23:55.900 --> 00:23:59.830
Everyone should find their favorite cheesecake too, okay?

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:04.480
