00:24:11.330 --> 00:24:13.320
And the theme that suits me the most, "Elephants!"

00:24:13.320 --> 00:24:14.680
You mean "Elegance", Ojou-sama.

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:18.690
I'm going to win the Grand Prix and then go on a lovey-dovey honeymoon with Makoto-kun to Paris, whee!

